{"id":"3289af078b707c62","group":"58","path":"58/batch02/58-df-zfc-game3-zero-sum-game.md","title":"ZFC Game3 Zero Sum Game","display":"df-zfc-game3-zero-sum-game — ZFC Game3 Zero Sum Game","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-game3-zero-sum-game","aliases":["58-df-zfc-game3-zero-sum-game"],"display":"df-zfc-game3-zero-sum-game — ZFC Game3 Zero Sum Game","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-game3-zero-sum-game"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-game3-zero-sum-game</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-game3-zero-sum-game — ZFC Game3 Zero Sum Game"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-finite.md\">../batch04/58-df-finite.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N,U,S,\\Sigma,u\\in V\">\\(N,U,S,\\Sigma,u\\in V\\)</span> (players, a common strategy carrier, strategy-set family, profile set, and payoff family)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcGame3ZeroSumGame}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcGame3ZeroSumGame}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Finite}\">\\(\\mathrm{Finite}\\)</span> (finite-set predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-finite.md\">../batch04/58-df-finite.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game3\\text{-}zero\\text{-}sum\\text{-}game} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcGame3ZeroSumGame}_S(N,U,S,\\Sigma,u)\\leftrightarrow\\left(\nN\\neq\\emptyset\\land\\mathrm{Finite}(N)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(S,N,\\mathcal P(U))\\land\n\\forall i\\in N\\;(S(i)\\neq\\emptyset)\\land\n\\Sigma=\\{\\sigma\\in U^N:\\forall i\\in N\\;(\\sigma(i)\\in S(i))\\}\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(u,N,\\mathbb R^{\\Sigma})\\land\n\\forall\\sigma\\in\\Sigma\\;\n\\left(\\sum_{i\\in N}u(i)(\\sigma)=0\\right)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game3\\text{-}zero\\text{-}sum\\text{-}game} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcGame3ZeroSumGame}_S(N,U,S,\\Sigma,u)\\leftrightarrow\\left(\nN\\neq\\emptyset\\land\\mathrm{Finite}(N)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(S,N,\\mathcal P(U))\\land\n\\forall i\\in N\\;(S(i)\\neq\\emptyset)\\land\n\\Sigma=\\{\\sigma\\in U^N:\\forall i\\in N\\;(\\sigma(i)\\in S(i))\\}\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(u,N,\\mathbb R^{\\Sigma})\\land\n\\forall\\sigma\\in\\Sigma\\;\n\\left(\\sum_{i\\in N}u(i)(\\sigma)=0\\right)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> 把策略族的值域限制为集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P(U)\">\\(\\mathcal P(U)\\)</span>，并把依赖乘积展开为具有逐坐标成员条件的函数集合，从而不依赖未声明的乘积算子。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3",